# Local web UI for the indian-statute profile. Dependencies and build output.
statute-web/node_modules/
statute-web/web-dist/

# `web/src/legalpdf.wasm` is deliberately NOT ignored, unlike most build output.
#
# It is compiled from the Rust in this repo, but the browser build needs it committed
# because Cloudflare Pages cannot compile it: the Pages image has no Rust toolchain and
# no `wasm32-unknown-unknown` target, and a from-scratch cargo release build of the whole
# engine does not fit the build time limit. Committing the 21 MB module means the deploy
# is `npm run build:web` — Node only — and always produces the module the Rust source
# currently builds to.
#
# Rebuild it with `npm run wasm` in `web/` and commit the result whenever the engine
# changes. `cargo quick` will not notice a stale one.

